# Per-Dockerfile build-context excludes for docker/dagster.Dockerfile
# (BuildKit: a `<Dockerfile-name>.dockerignore` next to the Dockerfile
# REPLACES the context root's .dockerignore for this build, so this file
# must be complete — it cannot rely on src/.dockerignore as a base).
#
# Context root is ./src (see docker-compose.yml + .github/workflows/ci.yml).
# The dagster image needs only dagster/ + georag_object_storage/; the
# sibling fastapi/ tree (which carries a 7.7 GB .venv and 1.8 GB models/
# on the dev workstation even before ignores) is dead weight here —
# excluding the whole subtree is both faster and safer than relying on
# the per-entry excludes.

fastapi/

**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.venv
dagster/.venv/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/htmlcov
**/dist
**/*.egg-info
**/.claude
**/tests/fixtures
